module bankr-de-local-rules.local-rules

import core.states.delaware.{ frbp9006-delaware }
import frbp.events.{ NoticeOfAppealServed, OrderForReliefEntered, PetitionFiled }

// The Bankr. D. Del. court's own periods and page limits, counted under FRBP
// 9006(a) as Local Rule 9006-1(a) directs: the Local Rules effective
// February 1, 2025. The FRBP periods (schedules, claims, the chapter 13
// plan, discharge, dischargeability, exemptions, the adversary answer and
// summons, appeals) are lit/frbp's and are not declared again.
//
// Stated in the rules but not declared: the FRBP's own periods the rules run
// on (a chapter 13 plan filed within 14 days of conversion, Rule
// 3023-1(c)(i)(A), FRBP 3015(b); the governmental units' bar date of 180
// days after the order for relief in a subchapter V case, Rule 3001-1(c), 11
// U.S.C. § 502(b)(9); the trustee's notice of final cure within 30 days
// after the debtor completes plan payments and the servicer's 21-day
// statement, Rule 3023-1(c)(ii)(N), FRBP 3002.1); the later-of periods (a
// proof of claim by the later of 21 days from notice of an amendment and the
// bar date, Rules 1009-1(a)(ii), 1009-2; exemption objections, discharge
// objections and dischargeability complaints by the later of the FRBP
// deadline and 28 or 60 days after an amendment adding a creditor or after a
// continued § 341 meeting concludes, Rules 4003-1(b), 4004-1, 4007-1; a pre-
// answer summary judgment answering brief, Rule 7056-1); the business-day,
// hour and clock-time periods (the 2 business days' notice before a chapter
// 11 petition, Rule 1002-1; the amended creditor matrix within 48 hours,
// Rule 1009-1(b); the 24-hour wait for a certificate of no objection or of
// counsel, Rules 7007-4, 9013-1(i), 9019-1(b); the discovery objection 1
// business day before the hearing, Rule 7026-1(b); the motion to quash by
// the business day before the deposition, Rule 7030-1(c); first day service
// within 48 hours, Rule 9013-1(m); the sealing motion within 3 business
// days, Rule 9018-1(d)(i); the 48-hour certificate of service of an order,
// Rule 9022-1; reply papers by 4:00 p.m. the day before the agenda deadline,
// Rule 9006-1(d); the agenda deadline, Rule 9029-3); the court's, clerk's,
// mediator's and judge's own acts (the clerk's transfer transmittal, Rule
// 1014-1; the mediator's notice of the conference and certificate of
// completion, Rule 9019-5(c)(ii), (f)(ii); the judge's opinion in support of
// an appealed order, Rule 8003-2); the bounds on the date a party sets
// rather than periods it runs (a Rule 2004 motion's objection deadline at
// least 7 and hearing at least 14 days after service, Rule 2004-1(a); 21
// days' notice of a retention hearing, Rule 2014-1(b); a claim objection
// response deadline at least 21 days after filing and 7 days before the
// hearing, Rule 3007-1(g); 28 days' notice of a chapter 12 confirmation
// hearing and an objection deadline 7 days before it, Rule 3015-1(b); a
// joint hearing at least 7 days after the objection deadline and a voting
// deadline 10 days before it, Rule 3017-2(b)(iv)-(v); a pretrial conference
// 35 to 90 days after the summons issues, Rule 7004-1; an objection deadline
// no earlier than 14 days after service on 21 days' notice, Rule
// 9006-1(c)(ii)); the conditions that are not deadlines (more than 200
// creditors, Rules 1007-1(a), 2002-1(e); an omnibus hearing not within 30
// days of a stay relief motion is consent to the stay continuing, Rule
// 4001-1(b)(i); the 75-day challenge period and 5 days' default notice a
// financing order must give, Rule 4001-2(a)(i)(Q), (S); a final financing
// hearing ordinarily 7 days after the committee's organizational meeting,
// Rule 4001-2(c); a status conference requested when no subchapter V
// confirmation hearing is set within 60 days of the plan, Rule 3017-4; a
// stipulated extension of up to 28 days to plead, Rule 7012-2; a deposition
// recess of less than 5 days, Rule 7030-1(d)); and the qualification years
// and annual reports of mediators (Rule 9019-2). The local forms are not
// vendored.
/// An objection to disclosure statement approval or plan confirmation,
/// excluding tables, exhibits, addenda and other supporting materials (Local
/// Rule 3017-3).
limit plan-objection { pages <= 40 cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3017-3" } cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3017-3"
/// A brief responding to objections and supporting disclosure statement
/// approval or plan confirmation, excluding tables, exhibits, addenda and
/// other supporting materials (Local Rule 3017-3).
limit plan-brief { pages <= 60 cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3017-3" } cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3017-3"

/// An opening or answering brief on a motion in an adversary proceeding,
/// exclusive of any tables of contents and citations (Local Rule
/// 7007-2(a)(iv)).
limit adversary-brief {
  pages <= 30 cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 7007-2(a)(iv)"
} cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 7007-2(a)(iv)"

/// A reply brief on a motion in an adversary proceeding, exclusive of any
/// tables of contents and citations (Local Rule 7007-2(a)(iv)).
limit adversary-reply-brief {
  pages <= 15 cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 7007-2(a)(iv)"
} cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 7007-2(a)(iv)"

/// A chapter 11 debtor's schedules are amended to change the amount, nature,
/// classification or characterization of a debt owed to a creditor (Local
/// Rule 1009-2).
event ScheduleAmendmentFiled()
/// The debtor or trustee serves the creditor with notice of a chapter 11
/// schedule amendment (Local Rule 1009-2).
event AmendmentNoticeServed()
/// The claims agent serves a document it is charged to serve (Local Rule
/// 2002-1(e)(i)).
event ClaimsAgentNoticeServed()
/// An order dismissing the case is entered (Local Rule 2002-1(e)(ix)).
event DismissalOrderEntered()
/// A final decree is entered in the case (Local Rules 2002-1(e)(ix),
/// 2002-1(f)(ii)).
event FinalDecreeEntered()
/// The earlier of an order converting the case and an order terminating the
/// claims agent's services is entered (Local Rule 2002-1(e)(x)).
event ClaimsAgentEndOrderEntered()
/// An order converting the case is entered (Local Rule 2002-1(f)(ii)).
event ConversionOrderEntered()
/// A notice of an agreed Rule 2004 examination or production is filed and
/// served (Local Rule 2004-1(b)).
event ExaminationNoticeServed()
/// The final fee order is entered in a case converted from chapter 11 to
/// chapter 7 (Local Rule 2016-1(i)).
event FinalFeeOrderEntered()
/// The hearing on a substantive omnibus objection to claims (Local Rule
/// 3007-1(d)(vi)).
event ClaimObjectionHearing()
/// The hearing on confirmation of a chapter 12 or chapter 13 plan (Local
/// Rules 3015-1(d), 3023-1(d)(i)).
event ConfirmationHearing()
/// The initial status conference in a subchapter V case (Local Rule
/// 3016-2(a)).
event InitialStatusConference()
/// The earlier of the deadline to submit ballots on the plan and the deadline
/// to object to its confirmation (Local Rule 3016-3).
event SolicitationDeadline()
/// The hearing on approval of a disclosure statement (Local Rule 3017-1).
event DisclosureStatementHearing()
/// The deadline to object to approval of the disclosure statement (Local Rule
/// 3017-1(a)).
event DisclosureObjectionDeadline()
/// A motion for a combined hearing on the disclosure statement and plan
/// confirmation is served (Local Rule 3017-2(b)(ii)).
event CombinedHearingMotionServed()
/// The hearing on a chapter 11 motion for a final decree (Local Rule
/// 3022-1(a)).
event FinalDecreeHearing()
/// The chapter 13 trustee serves the Notice of Final Cure and Completion of
/// Plan Payments (Local Rule 3023-1(c)(ii)(N)).
event FinalCureNoticeServed()
/// The servicer or mortgagee files a FRBP 3002.1(g) response alleging unpaid
/// cure amounts (Local Rule 3023-1(c)(ii)(N)).
event CureResponseFiled()
/// The hearing on a motion for relief from stay to exercise remedies against
/// collateral (Local Rule 4001-1(c)).
event StayReliefHearing()
/// The hearing on a chapter 7 trustee's final report and account (Local Rule
/// 5009-1(a)).
event FinalAccountHearing()
/// A chapter 15 foreign representative's motion for a final decree closing
/// the case is served (Local Rule 5009-2(b)).
event ClosingMotionServed()
/// The hearing on a motion to reopen a chapter 7 or 12 case (Local Rule
/// 5010-1(a)).
event ReopenHearing()
/// The hearing on a Sale Procedures Motion (Local Rule 6004-1(c)).
event SaleProceduresHearing()
/// The Summons and Notice of Pretrial Conference, complaint and notice of
/// dispute resolution alternatives are served (Local Rule 7004-1).
event SummonsServed()
/// The opening brief on a motion in an adversary proceeding is served (Local
/// Rule 7007-1(a)).
event OpeningBriefServed() paper adversary-brief
/// The answering brief on a motion in an adversary proceeding is served
/// (Local Rule 7007-1(a)).
event AnsweringBriefServed() paper adversary-brief
/// The reply brief, or the expiration without response of the time to answer
/// or reply, on a motion in an adversary proceeding (Local Rule 7007-3).
event ReplyBriefServed() paper adversary-reply-brief
/// Briefing on a motion in an adversary proceeding is concluded (Local Rule
/// 7007-4).
event BriefingConcluded()
/// The FRCP 16(b) scheduling conference, the pretrial conference the summons
/// sets (Local Rule 7016-1).
event SchedulingConference()
/// A pretrial conference following the completion of discovery (Local Rule
/// 7016-2).
event PretrialConference()
/// The hearing on a discovery motion under FRBP 7026-7037 or 9016 (Local Rule
/// 7026-1(b)).
event DiscoveryMotionHearing()
/// A deposition upon oral examination under FRCP 30(b) (Local Rule
/// 7030-1(b)).
event Deposition()
/// An objection to disclosure statement approval or plan confirmation is
/// filed (Local Rule 3017-3).
event PlanObjectionFiled() paper plan-objection
/// A brief supporting disclosure statement approval or plan confirmation is
/// filed (Local Rule 3017-3).
event PlanBriefFiled() paper plan-brief
/// An order disposing of an appeal in whole or in part issues, or a filing
/// reflects its resolution or withdrawal (Local Rule 8024-1).
event AppealDisposed()
/// The hearing date on a motion other than a discovery motion (Local Rule
/// 9006-1(c)).
event MotionHearing()
/// The first paper is filed on a party's behalf, or a case is transferred or
/// removed to the court (Local Rule 9010-1(d)).
event FirstPaperFiled()
/// The hearing on an attorney's motion to withdraw an appearance (Local Rule
/// 9010-2(b)).
event WithdrawalHearing()
/// An order is entered on a motion filed with a chapter 11 or 15 petition
/// (Local Rule 9013-1(m)).
event FirstDayOrderEntered()
/// The record on appeal is returned to the clerk (Local Rule 9018-1(c)).
event AppealRecordReturned()
/// The clerk notifies a party to remove its exhibits (Local Rule 9018-1(c)).
event ExhibitRemovalNotified()
/// A mediator or arbitrator receives notice of appointment (Local Rule
/// 9019-2(e)(ii)).
event MediatorAppointmentNoticed()
/// An arbitration award is filed with the clerk (Local Rule 9019-4(e)).
event ArbitrationAwardFiled()
/// The mediation conference (Local Rule 9019-5(c)).
event MediationConference()
/// A settlement is reached at a mediation (Local Rule 9019-5(f)(i)).
event MediationSettlement()
/// The Notice of Settlement is filed or an order approving the settlement is
/// entered (Local Rule 9019-5(f)(i)).
event SettlementNoticed()
/// The date a defendant's response is due under the Summons in an avoidance
/// proceeding of $75,000 or less from any one defendant (Local Rule
/// 9019-5(j)).
event AvoidanceResponseDue()
/// A defendant files the certificate opting in to the avoidance proceeding
/// mediation procedures (Local Rule 9019-5(j)).
event MediationCertificateFiled()
/// The plaintiff serves the notice of dispute resolution alternatives (Local
/// Rule 9019-7).
event AdrNoticeServed()

/// Local Rule 1007-1(a): if the debtor in a voluntary chapter 11 case has
/// more than 200 creditors and files with its petition the list Local Rule
/// 1007-2 requires, its time to file its Schedules and Statement of Financial
/// Affairs is extended to 28 days from the petition date; the time may be
/// further extended on motion for cause shown.
deadline chapter11-schedules-period: 28.days after PetitionFiled() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 1007-1(a)"

/// Local Rule 1009-2: when a chapter 11 debtor's schedules are amended to
/// change the amount, nature, classification or characterization of a
/// creditor's debt, the debtor or trustee serves notice of the amendment on
/// the creditor within 14 days of the amendment.
deadline amendment-notice-period: 14.days after ScheduleAmendmentFiled() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 1009-2"

/// Local Rule 1009-2: a certificate of service of the notice of a chapter 11
/// schedule amendment is filed within 7 days after service.
deadline amendment-certificate-period: 7.days after AmendmentNoticeServed() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 1009-2"

/// Local Rule 2002-1(e): a chapter 11 debtor with more than 200 parties on
/// its Local Rule 1007-2(a) list files the motion to retain a claims agent
/// with its petition or within 7 days thereafter, unless the court orders
/// otherwise.
deadline claims-agent-motion-period: 7.days after PetitionFiled() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 2002-1(e)"

/// Local Rule 2002-1(e)(ii): the claims agent files within 7 days after
/// service a certificate of service referencing the document served and its
/// docket number and each party served and the method of service.
deadline claims-agent-service-certificate-period: 7.days after ClaimsAgentNoticeServed() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 2002-1(e)(ii)"

/// Local Rule 2002-1(e)(ix): within 14 days after entry of an order
/// dismissing a case, the claims agent forwards the clerk an electronic
/// version of all proofs of claim, uploads the creditor matrix into CM/ECF
/// and dockets a final claims register.
deadline claims-agent-dismissal-register-period: 14.days after DismissalOrderEntered() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 2002-1(e)(ix)"

/// Local Rule 2002-1(e)(ix): within 28 days after entry of a final decree,
/// the claims agent forwards the clerk an electronic version of all proofs of
/// claim, uploads the creditor matrix into CM/ECF and dockets a final claims
/// register.
deadline claims-agent-decree-register-period: 28.days after FinalDecreeEntered() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 2002-1(e)(ix)"

/// Local Rule 2002-1(e)(x): within 14 days after the earlier of entry of an
/// order converting the case or terminating the claims agent's services, the
/// claims agent forwards the proofs of claim, uploads the public creditor
/// matrix, forwards its sealed portions and dockets a final claims register.
deadline claims-agent-conversion-register-period: 14.days after ClaimsAgentEndOrderEntered() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 2002-1(e)(x)"

/// Local Rule 2002-1(f)(ii): in a case with no claims agent, the debtor
/// provides an updated creditor matrix within 14 days after entry of an order
/// converting the case.
deadline conversion-matrix-period: 14.days after ConversionOrderEntered() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 2002-1(f)(ii)"

/// Local Rule 2002-1(f)(ii): in a case with no claims agent, the debtor
/// provides an updated creditor matrix within 28 days after entry of a final
/// decree.
deadline decree-matrix-period: 28.days after FinalDecreeEntered() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 2002-1(f)(ii)"

/// Local Rule 2004-1(b)(iii): a party in interest may object to an agreed
/// Rule 2004 examination notice within 7 days after it is filed and served;
/// Local Rule 7026-1 governs the objection unless the court orders otherwise.
deadline examination-notice-objection-period: 7.days after ExaminationNoticeServed() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 2004-1(b)(iii)"

/// Local Rule 2016-1(i): in a case converted from chapter 11 to chapter 7,
/// the proposed final fee order requires debtor's counsel to file, within 14
/// days of entry of the final fee order, a notice of the approved fees and
/// expenses paid and outstanding for all chapter 11 professionals.
deadline final-fee-notice-period: 14.days after FinalFeeOrderEntered() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 2016-1(i)"

/// Local Rule 3001-1(c): in a subchapter V case the general claims bar date
/// is 60 days after the order for relief, unless a court order or the Code
/// sets a different deadline.
deadline subchapter-v-bar-period: 60.days after OrderForReliefEntered() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3001-1(c)"

/// Local Rule 3007-1(d)(vi)(B)(1): for a substantive objection, unless the
/// presiding judge's procedure provides otherwise, the objector files and
/// delivers to chambers a Notice of Submission of Proofs of Claim with the
/// objection and copies of the claims at least 14 days before the hearing.
deadline claim-submission-notice-period: 14.days before ClaimObjectionHearing() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3007-1(d)(vi)"

/// Local Rule 3015-1(d): a chapter 12 debtor who amends the plan before the
/// confirmation hearing serves the amended plan and a new notice of hearing
/// on the trustee, all creditors and all parties requesting notice at least 7
/// days before the confirmation hearing.
deadline chapter12-amended-plan-period: 7.days before ConfirmationHearing() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3015-1(d)"

/// Local Rule 3023-1(d)(i): a chapter 13 amended plan filed before the
/// scheduled confirmation hearing is served on the scheduled creditors, the
/// chapter 13 trustee and the U.S. Trustee so that they receive it no less
/// than seven days before the confirmation hearing.
deadline chapter13-amended-plan-period: 7.days before ConfirmationHearing() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3023-1(d)(i)"

/// Local Rule 3016-2(a): a subchapter V debtor files a status report
/// substantially conforming to Local Form 136 at least 14 days before the
/// initial status conference.
deadline subchapter-v-status-report-period: 14.days before InitialStatusConference() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3016-2(a)"

/// Local Rule 3016-3: unless the court orders otherwise, the plan proponent
/// files any plan supplement at least 7 days before the earlier of the ballot
/// deadline and the deadline to object to confirmation.
deadline plan-supplement-period: 7.days before SolicitationDeadline() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3016-3"

/// Local Rule 3017-1(a): unless the court orders otherwise, the notice served
/// under FRBP 2002(b) and 3017 gives at least 35 days' notice of the
/// disclosure statement hearing.
deadline disclosure-hearing-notice-period: 35.days before DisclosureStatementHearing() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3017-1(a)"

/// Local Rule 3017-1(a): unless the court orders otherwise, the notice gives
/// at least 28 days' notice of the deadline to object to approval of the
/// disclosure statement.
deadline disclosure-objection-notice-period: 28.days before DisclosureObjectionDeadline() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3017-1(a)"

/// Local Rule 3017-1(b): the plan proponent files a motion to approve the
/// voting procedures (the ballots, the voting agent and the time and manner
/// of voting) at least 21 days before the disclosure statement hearing; Local
/// Rule 9006-1(c)(i) states the same 21 days.
deadline voting-procedures-motion-period: 21.days before DisclosureStatementHearing() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3017-1(b)"

/// Local Rule 3017-2(b)(ii): a combined hearing motion is filed at least 21
/// days before the hearing; if no objection is filed within 14 days after the
/// motion is served, the court may grant it without a hearing.
deadline combined-hearing-objection-period: 14.days after CombinedHearingMotionServed() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3017-2(b)(ii)"

/// Local Rule 3022-1(a)(i): a chapter 11 motion for a final decree is served
/// on the Local Rule 2002-1(b) parties at least 21 days before the hearing.
deadline final-decree-service-period: 21.days before FinalDecreeHearing() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3022-1(a)(i)"

/// Local Rule 3022-1(a)(ii): the debtor or trustee files a final report and
/// account at least 14 days before the hearing on the motion for a final
/// decree.
deadline final-report-period: 14.days before FinalDecreeHearing() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3022-1(a)(ii)"

/// Local Rule 3023-1(c)(ii)(N): within 21 days of service of the trustee's
/// Notice of Final Cure and Completion of Plan Payments, the chapter 13
/// debtor files an executed Local Form 104.
deadline completion-certification-period: 21.days after FinalCureNoticeServed() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3023-1(c)(ii)(N)"

/// Local Rule 3023-1(c)(ii)(N): within 21 days of the filing of a servicer's
/// FRBP 3002.1(g) response asserting unpaid plan arrears, the trustee submits
/// evidence of the payments made on the allowed arrears claim and files a
/// certification with the court.
deadline cure-response-evidence-period: 21.days after CureResponseFiled() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 3023-1(c)(ii)(N)"

/// Local Rule 4001-1(c)(ii): a party opposing a motion for relief from stay
/// to exercise remedies against collateral files and serves its response and
/// an affidavit of the amount due and the collateral's value at least 7 days
/// before the hearing.
deadline stay-relief-response-period: 7.days before StayReliefHearing() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 4001-1(c)(ii)"

/// Local Rule 5009-1(a): the chapter 7 trustee's notice of a final report and
/// account states that a person seeking compensation, reimbursement or
/// administrative expenses files a motion and serves the trustee and the U.S.
/// Trustee at least 21 days before the hearing on the final account.
deadline final-account-fee-motion-period: 21.days before FinalAccountHearing() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 5009-1(a)"

/// Local Rule 5009-2(b): if no objection to a chapter 15 foreign
/// representative's motion for a final decree is filed within 30 days after
/// service, the case is presumed fully administered and the court may enter
/// the final decree.
deadline chapter15-closing-objection-period: 30.days after ClosingMotionServed() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 5009-2(b)"

/// Local Rule 5010-1(a): a motion to reopen a chapter 7 or 12 case is served
/// on the debtor, the U.S. Trustee, the case trustee and all other parties in
/// interest at least 21 days before the hearing.
deadline reopen-service-period: 21.days before ReopenHearing() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 5010-1(a)"

/// Local Rule 6004-1(c): a Sale Procedures Motion is filed not less than 21
/// days before the hearing on it, and the court hears it on at least 21 days'
/// notice unless a motion to shorten notice is granted; Local Rule
/// 9006-1(c)(i) states the same 21 days.
deadline sale-procedures-motion-period: 21.days before SaleProceduresHearing() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 6004-1(c)"

/// Local Rule 7004-1: the completed Summons and certificate of service are
/// filed in the adversary proceeding within 7 days after service of the
/// Summons, complaint and notice of dispute resolution alternatives.
deadline summons-certificate-period: 7.days after SummonsServed() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 7004-1"

/// Local Rule 7007-1(a)(ii): unless the court orders or the parties agree
/// otherwise, the answering brief and any supporting affidavit or appendix on
/// a motion in an adversary proceeding are filed and served no later than 14
/// days after service of the opening brief.
deadline answering-brief-period: 14.days after OpeningBriefServed() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 7007-1(a)(ii)"

/// Local Rule 7007-1(a)(iii): the reply brief and any supporting affidavit or
/// appendix are filed and served no later than seven days after service of
/// the answering brief.
deadline reply-brief-period: 7.days after AnsweringBriefServed() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 7007-1(a)(iii)"

/// Local Rule 7007-3: an application for oral argument on an adversary
/// proceeding motion is filed and served no later than 3 days after service
/// of the reply brief or expiration without response of the deadline to
/// answer or reply.
deadline oral-argument-application-period: 3.days after ReplyBriefServed() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 7007-3"

/// Local Rule 7007-4: counsel to the movant files and serves the Notice of
/// Completion of Briefing no later than 7 days after briefing is concluded.
deadline briefing-completion-notice-period: 7.days after BriefingConcluded() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 7007-4"

/// Local Rule 7016-1(a): the attorneys for all parties confer at least 7 days
/// before the FRCP 16(b) scheduling conference.
deadline scheduling-conference-meet-period: 7.days before SchedulingConference() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 7016-1(a)"

/// Local Rule 7016-1(d): the plaintiff files a proposed scheduling order no
/// later than 3 days before the scheduling conference.
deadline plaintiff-scheduling-order-period: 3.days before SchedulingConference() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 7016-1(d)"

/// Local Rule 7016-1(d): any other party may file a proposed scheduling order
/// no later than 1 day before the scheduling conference.
deadline other-party-scheduling-order-period: 1.days before SchedulingConference() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 7016-1(d)"

/// Local Rule 7016-2(a): the attorney for the party requesting a pretrial
/// conference after discovery gives all parties in interest at least 14 days'
/// notice of its time and place.
deadline pretrial-conference-notice-period: 14.days before PretrialConference() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 7016-2(a)"

/// Local Rule 7016-2(d): at least 7 days before the final pretrial
/// conference, the plaintiff's attorney files a proposed pretrial order
/// signed by an attorney for each party.
deadline pretrial-order-period: 7.days before PretrialConference() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 7016-2(d)"

/// Local Rule 7026-1(b): all motion papers under FRBP 7026-7037 and 9016 are
/// filed and served so as to be received at least 7 days before the hearing
/// date.
deadline discovery-motion-notice-period: 7.days before DiscoveryMotionHearing() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 7026-1(b)"

/// Local Rule 7030-1(b): unless the court orders otherwise, reasonable notice
/// of a deposition under FRCP 30(b) is not less than 7 days.
deadline deposition-notice-period: 7.days before Deposition() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 7030-1(b)"

/// Local Rule 8003-1(c): an official committee wishing to be on the service
/// list for an appeal files a request for notice within 21 days of service of
/// the notice of appeal or cross-appeal.
deadline committee-appeal-notice-period: 21.days after NoticeOfAppealServed() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 8003-1(c)"

/// Local Rule 8024-1: within 3 days of issuance of an order disposing of an
/// appeal in whole or in part, or of a filing reflecting its resolution or
/// withdrawal, counsel for the appellant files notice of the disposition and
/// gives the bankruptcy judge a copy.
deadline appeal-disposition-notice-period: 3.days after AppealDisposed() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 8024-1"

/// Local Rule 9006-1(c)(i): unless the FRBP or the Local Rules state
/// otherwise, all motion papers are filed and served under Local Rule
/// 2002-1(b) at least 14 days before the hearing date.
deadline motion-service-period: 14.days before MotionHearing() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9006-1(c)(i)"

/// Local Rule 9006-1(c)(ii): where a motion is filed and served less than 21
/// days before the hearing date, the deadline for objections is 7 days before
/// the hearing date (on 21 days' notice the movant may set any deadline no
/// earlier than 14 days after service and no later than 7 days before the
/// hearing).
deadline motion-objection-period: 7.days before MotionHearing() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9006-1(c)(ii)"

/// Local Rule 9010-1(d): a party not appearing pro se obtains representation
/// by, or has its counsel associate with, a member of the District Court bar
/// within 28 days after the first paper filed on its behalf or the filing of
/// a case transferred or removed to the court.
deadline delaware-counsel-period: 28.days after FirstPaperFiled() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9010-1(d)"

/// Local Rule 9010-2(b): a motion to withdraw an appearance is served on each
/// party, and on the client by registered or certified mail, at least 14 days
/// before the motion is heard.
deadline withdrawal-service-period: 14.days before WithdrawalHearing() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9010-2(b)"

/// Local Rule 9013-1(m)(v): unless the court orders otherwise, a party in
/// interest may move to reconsider a First Day Order (other than a cash
/// collateral or postpetition financing order under §§ 363 and 364) within 28
/// days of its entry.
deadline first-day-reconsideration-period: 28.days after FirstDayOrderEntered() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9013-1(m)(v)"

/// Local Rule 9018-1(c): if an appeal has been taken, exhibits in the clerk's
/// custody are removed by the responsible party within 28 days after the
/// record on appeal is returned to the clerk.
deadline appeal-exhibit-removal-period: 28.days after AppealRecordReturned() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9018-1(c)"

/// Local Rule 9018-1(c): the clerk may dispose of exhibits a party fails to
/// remove 28 days after notifying it to remove them.
deadline exhibit-notice-removal-period: 28.days after ExhibitRemovalNotified() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9018-1(c)"

/// Local Rule 9019-2(e)(ii): a mediator or arbitrator unable or electing not
/// to serve files and serves a notice of inability to accept the appointment
/// within 14 days after receipt of notice of appointment.
deadline mediator-declination-period: 14.days after MediatorAppointmentNoticed() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9019-2(e)(ii)"

/// Local Rule 9019-4(f)(i): within 30 days after an arbitration award is
/// filed with the clerk, any party may file a written demand for a
/// determination de novo.
deadline arbitration-de-novo-period: 30.days after ArbitrationAwardFiled() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9019-4(f)(i)"

/// Local Rule 9019-5(c)(iii): unless the mediator instructs otherwise, each
/// party submits its Submission to the mediator and serves it on all counsel
/// and pro se parties not less than 7 days before the mediation conference.
deadline mediation-submission-period: 7.days before MediationConference() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9019-5(c)(iii)"

/// Local Rule 9019-5(f)(i): if a settlement is reached at a mediation, the
/// plaintiff files a Notice of Settlement or a motion and proposed order
/// seeking approval within 28 days after the settlement is reached.
deadline mediation-settlement-filing-period: 28.days after MediationSettlement() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9019-5(f)(i)"

/// Local Rule 9019-5(f)(i): within 60 days after the Notice of Settlement is
/// filed or an order approving the settlement is entered, the parties file a
/// Stipulation of Dismissal; otherwise the clerk's office closes the case.
deadline mediation-dismissal-period: 60.days after SettlementNoticed() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9019-5(f)(i)"

/// Local Rule 9019-5(j): in an avoidance proceeding of $75,000 or less from
/// any one defendant, the defendant may opt in to prompt mediation by filing
/// and serving a Local Form 118 certificate on or within 28 days after its
/// response is due under the Summons; an agreed extension of the response
/// deadline does not extend this period.
deadline avoidance-mediation-opt-in-period: 28.days after AvoidanceResponseDue() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9019-5(j)"

/// Local Rule 9019-5(j): within 7 days after the opt-in certificate is filed,
/// the parties file a Local Form 119 stipulation appointing a mediator,
/// failing which the court assigns one.
deadline avoidance-mediator-stipulation-period: 7.days after MediationCertificateFiled() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9019-5(j)"

/// Local Rule 9019-7: a certificate of service of the notice of dispute
/// resolution alternatives is filed within 7 days of service of the notice.
deadline adr-notice-certificate-period: 7.days after AdrNoticeServed() counted_by frbp9006-delaware cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9019-7"

start motion-filed

state motion-filed: "Motion filed and served with notice of hearing" by applicant cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9006-1(c)"
{
  note "Unless the FRBP or the Local Rules state otherwise, motion papers are filed and served on the Local Rule 2002-1(b) parties at least 14 days before the hearing date, and Sale Procedures and voting procedures motions at least 21 days before it (Local Rule 9006-1(c)(i)); less notice requires an order on a motion to shorten (Local Rule 9006-1(e)). Discovery motions follow Local Rule 7026-1 (Local Rule 9006-1(b))."
  edge-motion-filed-objection "Objection filed by the objection deadline" -> objected {
    authority cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9006-1(c)(ii)"
  }
  edge-motion-filed-unopposed "No objection; certificate of no objection filed" -> ruling {
    authority cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9013-1(i)"
  }
}

state objected: "Objection filed; reply and hearing" by opponent cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9006-1(c)(ii)"
{
  note "Any objection is filed on or before the applicable objection deadline, which may be extended by the movant's agreement but not beyond the agenda deadline (Local Rule 9006-1(c)(ii)); reply papers may be filed by 4:00 p.m. prevailing Eastern Time the day before the agenda deadline (Local Rule 9006-1(d))."
  edge-objected-hearing "Hearing held" -> ruling { authority cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9006-1(d)" }
}

decision ruling: "Motion decided" by court cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9013-1(i)"
{
  note "On a certificate of no objection, filed 24 hours after the objection date has passed (counted under FRBP 9006(a)(2)), the court may enter the order without a hearing (Local Rule 9013-1(i))."
  edge-ruling-granted "Granted" -> decided { authority cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9013-1(i)" }
  edge-ruling-denied "Denied" -> decided { authority cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 9006-1(c)" }
}

terminal decided: "Matter decided: the case continues under lit/frbp" outcome [procedural] cite "Del. Bankr. L.R. 1001-1(b)"
{
  note "The Local Rules govern insofar as they are not inconsistent with the Code and the FRBP (Local Rule 1001-1(b)); they govern cases and proceedings filed after February 1, 2025 and those then pending unless the court finds them infeasible or unjust (Local Rule 1001-1(e)-(f))."
}

